{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08061","headline":"鸣雁行 · 李白","name":"鸣雁行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡雁鸣，辞燕山，昨发委羽朝度关。\n一一衔芦枝，南飞散落天地间。\n连行接翼往复还，客居烟波寄湘吴。\n凌霜触雪毛体枯，畏逢矰缴惊相呼。\n闻弦虚坠良可吁，君更弹射何爲乎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08061.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08061","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}